I've done plenty of flying kicks for 1 damage.<P>My two biggest gripes about the monk class are, one, our middle level quests take between 150-500 hours each to complete (necros take about 4-5 hours each, cleric around 5-6 hours each)  You could collect 6 pairs of j-boots in the time it takes you to complete the easiest mid-level monk armor quest.<P>Second is our armor sucks.  Any single piece of the warriors cobalt armor has more AC then our entire set of planes armor.  That's ridiculous.  When cobalt, myrlokors (sp?) and donals armors sets came out for the warrior, rogue and cleric we also got a new set of armor.  But I don't even know the name of the armor, because its so bad the name isn't worth committing to memory.  Its the same AC as raw silk, weighs 0.1 and has crappy stats like +2 agi.  This is armor for a melee class and is basically on par with what a 5th level untwinked caster would be wearing.
