ack Saphire HP+55 (8000pp)<BR>*Runed Lava Pendant 5AC 0.2 STR+5 Sv Fire+5 (3150pp)<BR>Necklace of Defiance 8AC 0.1 (10pp)<P>SHOULDERS Drolvarg Mantle<BR>Sode of Empowerment 10AC 0.1 STA,STR,AGI,DEX+7 (no drop)<P>WAIST: Thick Leather Apron 8AC 1.0 (20-30pp)<BR>*Thick Banded Belt 8AC 0.8 STR+15 (6000-8000pp)<BR>*Flowing Black Silk Sash AC 0 Haste 0.1 (12,500pp)<BR> <BR>WRIST: Silver Plate Bracer 7AC 1.0 Sv poison/disease+5 (95pp)<BR>WRIST: Symbol of loyalty to Vox 7AC 0.3 Sv Cold+7 (80pp)<BR>ALT: Bracer of Erolisi 5AC 1.0 STR+5 (40-80pp)<BR>Gold Jade 2AC 0.0 HP+15 (38-40pp)<BR>Hero Bracer STR+10 Sv Disease/poison+5 (3200pp)
